<title>UK: BOE allots 50 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 50 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 50 million stg of assistance in the form of 6.5 percent repos to June 23.</p>
<p>This brought total liquidity provided to the market to 150 million stg, the same as the Bank's latest estimate of the day's liquidity shortage.</p>
